author=kabukabu
description=ColorOS (国行) FCM push guardian: detects and clears the stopped flag on GMS and chosen apps, disables the ColorOS GMS wakelock restriction (google_restric_info), keeps targets on the Doze whitelist and wakes the push chain with GCM heartbeats. Shell-only, uid 2000, no root.
webui=webui
action=action.sh
usesShellBridge=true
